OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent at times. Turning more
OL,8,Fshowery through the afternoon with
OL,9,Foccasional brighter spells. Breezy,
OL,10,Fstrong coastal winds during the
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe showers becoming more
OL,14,Fscattered during this evening with the
OL,15,Fcloud thinning and breaking. Any
OL,16,Fshowers confined to the west
OL,17,Fovernight, mainly dry with clear
OL,18,Fspells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
