OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,6,Fwith the best of the sunshine during
OL,7,Fthe morning. Thickening cloud bringing
OL,8,Fpatchy rain during the evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,11,Fand windy early on Saturday, turning
OL,12,Fdrier and brighter from the west.
OL,13,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday then
OL,14,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain on
OL,15,FMonday.
